to build, go to main metrinome directory and run:
sudo docker build -t apcmetrinome/issta -f replication/Dockerfile .

to push to dockerhub:
sudo docker login
sudo docker push apcmetrinome/issta

to run the docker image (without externally copied results):
sudo docker login
sudo docker run -it apcmetrinome/issta

to run the docker image (with externally copied results):
sudo docker login
sudo docker run -v ./results:/app/code/experiments/function_calls/data -it apcmetrinome/issta


to run experiments inside docker:
./Testing.sh

to view results of experiments:
open the "results" folder automatically generated in the directory the docker image is running in
open final_data.csv

notes:
the full experiments will take some time to run, up to a day
the full experiments should not be run on a personal computer or laptop
the other csv files in "results" display the data of each of apc-r, napc-ip, and apc-ip separately
